  "keyFeatures": [
    "Renders HL7® FHIR® R4 and R5 Questionnaires as interactive React forms",
    "Headless architecture — bring your own theme and CSS",
    "Pluggable theme system with built-in hs-theme, nshuk-theme, antd-theme, and mantine-theme",
    "SDC (Structured Data Capture) support including enableWhen, calculated expressions, and launchContext",
    "ValueSet expansion via configurable terminology server",
    "Multilingual support via useStrings() and questionnaire language switching",
    "Controlled and uncontrolled rendering modes",
    "Full TypeScript support with versioned FHIR type helpers",
    "MobX-powered reactive form state management",
    "Pagination, repeating groups, and complex FHIR item types"
  ],
